      "content": "it's more than just a \"coincidence\" though. i can actually feel the frequency of the flare in my body, like a vibration in my nervous system that opens up my capacity to understand people. do you think there could be a more direct, biological-level interaction between solar radiation and human neural pathways? like i'm basically acting as a living sensor for it.",
